716:\paragraph*{``Edge states'' and the Lieb-Schultz-Mattis type theorems}
717-We consider a quantum spin system on the infinite chain $\bbZ$ with a certain symmetry group $G$, accompanied by a homomorphism $\ua$ giving the decomposition $G=G^+ \sqcup G^-$.
