  2751	\section{On-site group symmetry}\label{onsite}
  2752	For a Hilbert space $\caK$, we denote by $\caU(\caK)$ the set of all unitaries on $\caK$.
  2753	Let $G$ be a {\new {finite}} group and $w:G\to \caU(\bbC^{2S+1})$ a unitary representation of
