  2765	\bigotimes_I w(g)^*\rmk,\quad g\in G,\quad A\in\caA_I,
  2766	\end{align}
  2767	for any finite interval $I$ of $\bbZ$.
  2768	A state $\varphi$ on $\caA$ is $G$-invariant if $\varphi\circ T_g=\varphi$ for any $g\in G$.
  2769	As $T_g (\caA_R)=\caA_R$, the restriction $T_{g,R}:=\left. T_g\right \vert_{\caA_R}$
  2770	is a $*$-automorphism on $\caA_R$. 
