417-The quotient group $H^{2}(G,\bbT):=Z^{2}(G,\bbT)/ B^{2}(G,\bbT)$ 
418:is called the second cohomology group of $G$.
419:For each $\sigma\in Z^{2}(G,\bbT)$, we denote by $[\sigma]_{H^{2}(G,\bbT)}$ the second cohomology class that $\sigma$ belongs to.
