314:%smooth path of quasi-local automorphisms $s\mapsto \alpha_s$. 
315:Under such conditions, we show that there is a smooth path of
316-quasi-local automorphisms $\alpha_s$, such that $\omega_s=\omega_0\circ \alpha_s$.
317-This $\alpha_s$ is the same as the one given in the literatures \cite{BMNS}, \cite{NSY}.
