+3. **`OG-LSM-KINK-SCOPE` — no new row needed.**  It is a literature boundary
+   statement: no-go on qualifying tails, no direct no-go on the D9 kink.
+
+No shared repository file is targeted, so no `PATCH.md` is proposed.
