+
+## 4. Structured correspondence conclusion
+
+**ASSUME.**  D21--D22 and D26--D27; live claims M-INDEX-fin,
+M-INDEX-spec, M-INDEX-LA-folium, M-INDEX-LA-strong, M-IDX-density,
