+
+*Justification.*  D27(LR2)--(LR3); claims M-INDEX-spec and SPT-M';
+OGA-AUTO Theorem `main` quoted in §1.
+
+**⟨1⟩5.**  The newly proved fixed-kink folium implementer gives a distinct
